# 行尾规范化：Windows 项目强制 CRLF，防 lib.js ↔ run-plans.js 跨平台编辑混入 LF
# 导致 sync.test.js 的 promptBody 正则失配（T5 曾踩坑）。
# sync.test.js 的"行尾一致性"测试是第二道保险，此文件是根因防护。
#
# ⚠️ 规则顺序关键：git 对同一属性取「最后匹配的规则」生效。
# 通配兜底（*）必须在最前，具体后缀（*.js 等）在后才能覆盖；
# 写反了 `* binary`(=-text) 会盖掉前面的 `*.js text`，CRLF 强制全失效
# （commit 1737a72 曾踩此坑 → sync.test 11 fail 报警，run-plans/lib 行尾分裂）。
#
# P2-11b（第 11 轮）: `* binary` 兜底设 binary 宏（= -text -diff），`*.js text eol=crlf`
#   覆盖 text/eol 但**未覆盖 diff** → `diff: unset` 残留 → git diff 显示 "Bin files differ"。
#   修：所有 text 规则加 `diff` 显式启用 text diff（撤销 binary 宏的 -diff）。

# 兜底：未明确指定的文件视为 binary（必须在最前，让后面具体规则覆盖）
* binary

# P2-12b（第 12 轮）: .gitattributes 自身须启用 text diff（否则 * binary 兜底致自身 diff 不可读）
.gitattributes text eol=crlf diff

# 源码 / 配置 / 文档：强制 CRLF + 启用 text diff（checkout 与 commit 均保留 CRLF）
# 后端 Python
*.py   text eol=crlf diff
*.toml text eol=crlf diff
*.ini  text eol=crlf diff
*.mako text eol=crlf diff
# 前端 Vue3 + TypeScript
*.js   text eol=crlf diff
*.jsx  text eol=crlf diff
*.mjs  text eol=crlf diff
*.cjs  text eol=crlf diff
*.ts   text eol=crlf diff
*.tsx  text eol=crlf diff
*.vue  text eol=crlf diff
*.css  text eol=crlf diff
*.scss text eol=crlf diff
*.less text eol=crlf diff
*.html text eol=crlf diff
*.htm  text eol=crlf diff
# 数据 / 文档
*.json text eol=crlf diff
*.yaml text eol=crlf diff
*.yml  text eol=crlf diff
*.md   text eol=crlf diff
# Plan 09：*.sh 与 .env.example 被 * binary 兜底致 diff 不可读，开 text diff（不加 eol=crlf，防 CRLF 破坏 shell）
*.sh  text diff
.env.example text diff
# Plan 09 final: 无后缀文件被 * binary 兜底致 diff 不可读，开 text diff（不加 eol=crlf，保持 LF）
LICENSE        text diff
Dockerfile     text diff
.gitignore     text diff
.dockerignore  text diff
